<p>WIDEn-N digipeaters are the backbone of regional APRS coverage — typically mountaintop or otherwise high-elevation stations that relay traffic across a wide area.</p>

<p>This page covers recommended configuration parameters. For a digipeater that also reports weather data, see <a href="/widen-n-wx-digi/" class="text-signal-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-signal-500">WIDEn-N/WX Digi</a>. For lower-power local coverage, see <a href="/fill-in-digi/" class="text-signal-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-signal-500">Fill-In Digi</a>.</p>
